        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Vacations shall be scheduled for not less than four (4) consecutive hour increments (3.3 hours for third shift) taken at either the beginning or end of the regularly scheduled shift. Vacation may be taken on any day(s) of the workweek provided they have been scheduled in advance and approved by supervision.",
